# Virtual Grid Engine — Core Mandate

This repo implements a **config-driven, plugin-first table engine** (public npm library).

## Before any change

1. Apply skill **virtual-grid-engine** (`.cursor/skills/virtual-grid-engine/SKILL.md`).
2. Read the relevant reference under `.cursor/skills/virtual-grid-engine/references/` — do not guess architecture.

## Absolute rules

- **Consumers configure; they never modify engine internals.**
- **8 layers** with strict import boundaries — no cross-layer violations, no circular imports.
- **Config cascade order is fixed** — do not reorder schema resolution or render pipeline stages.
- **Components are pure UI** — state/handlers via props only; hooks wired in the HOC only.
- **`src/index.ts` only** defines public exports; `utils/` and `constants/` stay `@internal`.
- **Table UI** uses the engine’s div-based virtualized grid only — not HTML `<table>` or alternate grid libs.
- **TypeScript**: no `any`; explicit types on public boundaries.

When implementation conflicts with a reference doc, **fix the code to match the standard** unless the user explicitly changes the standard.
